00:11:36.062 --> 00:11:37.129
Follow me!

00:11:37.129 --> 00:11:38.364
- Through there?

00:11:38.364 --> 00:11:40.433
(whirring wind)

00:11:40.433 --> 00:11:42.468
(futuristic synth sounds)

00:11:42.468 --> 00:11:44.103
(Wally laughs)

00:11:44.103 --> 00:11:46.672
- Whoa! Look at this place.

00:11:47.573 --> 00:11:48.874
Where are we?

00:11:48.874 --> 00:11:51.110
- Just be patient
and I'll show ya.

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:53.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
- What? Your suit changed!
(upbeat music begins)

00:11:53.112 --> 00:11:54.714
- ♪ Follow me to
a place I know ♪

00:11:54.714 --> 00:11:56.716
Where there ain't no
place and no sorrow

00:11:56.716 --> 00:11:58.684
It's a place to be
if your skin is brown

00:12:00.886 --> 00:12:04.490
I'm talkin' bout Negrotown ♪

00:12:06.058 --> 00:12:06.992
- Negrotown?

00:12:06.992 --> 00:12:08.928
What, like, Atlanta?

00:12:08.928 --> 00:12:10.162
(Wally laughs)

00:12:10.162 --> 00:12:12.565
- Almost. Now, be
quiet while I sing.

00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:15.334 align:start size:84% position:16%
♪ Negrotown, you can
walk the street ♪

00:12:15.334 --> 00:12:17.403 align:start size:88% position:13%
Without gettin' stopped,
harassed, or beat

00:12:17.403 --> 00:12:20.806
There's always a cab when
you need to get around ♪

00:12:21.774 --> 00:12:22.808
- And they always stop!

00:12:22.808 --> 00:12:27.580
♪ In Negrotown ♪

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.848
- I think I'm getting it.

00:12:28.848 --> 00:12:30.649
It's like a utopia
for black people!

00:12:30.649 --> 00:12:32.384
- Yeah! But seriously.

00:12:32.384 --> 00:12:34.420
Shut the (beep) up.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:38.491
♪ Won't get followed
while you try to shop ♪

00:12:38.491 --> 00:12:42.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
- ♪ You can wear your
hoodie and not get shot ♪

00:12:42.361 --> 00:12:46.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
- ♪ No white folks to
cross the street in fear ♪

00:12:46.232 --> 00:12:50.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
- ♪ No trigger happy
cops or scared cashiers ♪

00:12:50.202 --> 00:12:54.240 align:start size:84% position:16%
- [Wally] ♪ That loan
application can't
get turned down ♪

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:57.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
- [Banker] ♪ You're always
approved in Negrotown ♪

00:12:57.743 --> 00:12:58.577
- This is amazing!

00:12:58.577 --> 00:13:00.045
- I know, right?

00:13:00.045 --> 00:13:01.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
- [Dancers] ♪ We're
going down to Negrotown ♪

00:13:01.514 --> 00:13:03.482
Where the strong black
men are raining down

00:13:03.482 --> 00:13:05.584 align:start size:84% position:16%
There's light-skin,
dark-skin, every shade

00:13:07.787 --> 00:13:11.123 align:start size:97% position:3%
And there's no white
bitches to take them away ♪

00:13:13.993 --> 00:13:15.494
- This sounds too
good to be true!

00:13:15.494 --> 00:13:17.496
- It does, doesn't it?

00:13:17.496 --> 00:13:19.498
But can I (bleep)
finish the song?

00:13:19.498 --> 00:13:22.501
- I mean, can a (bleep) finish?

00:13:22.501 --> 00:13:24.637
- I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:13:24.637 --> 00:13:26.572 align:start size:88% position:13%
- ♪ In Negrotown, you'll
live long and well ♪

00:13:26.572 --> 00:13:28.507 align:start size:84% position:16%
There's no disease,
no sickle cell

00:13:28.507 --> 00:13:30.943 align:start size:88% position:13%
No stupid ass white
folks touching your hair

00:13:30.943 --> 00:13:33.212
Or stealin' your coats
or gleaming in stairs.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:38.751
Hanging out in a group
doesn't make you a gang

00:13:38.751 --> 00:13:42.721
Every word that you say
ain't considered slang.

00:13:42.721 --> 00:13:46.058
No one trying to get
in on the latest trend,

00:13:46.058 --> 00:13:48.961
By making you their
token black friend.

00:13:48.961 --> 00:13:53.499
It's a place where
all Madea's found ♪

00:13:53.499 --> 00:13:57.636
- ♪ It's a (bleep)
black playground ♪

00:13:57.636 --> 00:14:02.541
- ♪ Talkin' bout Negrotown ♪

00:14:05.377 --> 00:14:10.382
- ♪ Talkin' bout Negrotown! ♪

00:14:15.955 --> 00:14:18.324
(distant voices)

00:14:18.324 --> 00:14:19.959
- Sir?

00:14:19.959 --> 00:14:21.493
Sir?

00:14:21.493 --> 00:14:22.328
Sir?

00:14:23.529 --> 00:14:24.363
Sir.

00:14:26.932 --> 00:14:27.766
Alright, get up.

00:14:28.734 --> 00:14:29.835
Let's go, get up.

00:14:31.003 --> 00:14:32.972 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Wait, wait, wait,
hold on, wait.

00:14:32.972 --> 00:14:35.474 align:start size:84% position:16%
I thought I was
goin' to Negrotown?

00:14:35.474 --> 00:14:36.742
- Oh, you are.

00:14:36.742 --> 00:14:39.845
(upbeat piano music)

00:14:43.749 --> 00:14:46.752
(car engine starts)

00:14:51.123 --> 00:14:54.126
(upbeat scat music)

